        """Generate swift using Faker.

        Generate a SWIFT code.

        SWIFT codes, reading from left to right, are composed of a 4 alphabet
        character bank code, a 2 alphabet character country code, a 2 alphanumeric
        location code, and an optional 3 alphanumeric branch code. This means SWIFT
        codes can only have 8 or 11 characters, so the value of ``length`` can only
        be ``None`` or the integers ``8`` or ``11``. If the value is ``None``, then
        a value of ``8`` or ``11`` will randomly be assigned.

